o conduct high-risk AI research without getting bogged down in manual bookkeeping, thereby protecting the institution's capacity for frontier research.\n\n    *   Rationale: By automating regulatory record-keeping within the MLOps pipeline, this proposal removes administrative friction from the research process, allowing scientists to focus on intellectual merit while ensuring rigorous traceability of experimental iterations.\n    *   Decision: approve.\n    *   Promise: 95 (Highly promising because it solves a compliance headache without hindering scientific agility).",
