        "content": "{\n  \"screenings\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"P1779\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Allocating three dedicated personnel for two quarters to develop a support utility represents an inefficient use of R&D resources that should be focused on core AI capabilities rather than compliance tooling. While market differentiation is a secondary benefit, this proposal describes a productization effort that diverts talent away from scientific ambition.\",\n      \"decision\": \"reject\",\n      \"promise\": 30\n    }\n  ]\n}",
